[4.295, "o", "usage: hmz [-h] COMMAND ...\r\n\r\nOrchestrate, execute, and observe agent flows. Running without a command opens the terminal\r\ninterface where this directory left off.\r\n\r\npositional arguments:\r\n  COMMAND\r\n    exec      run an agent flow in this directory\r\n    internal  internal commands used by humanize; do not run directly\r\n\r\noptions:\r\n  -h, --help  show this help message and exit\r\n\r\nRun `hmz COMMAND --help` for more information on a command.\r\n"]
